OL,3,GNEWSASecond man jailed for attacking
OL,4,Aboys with keys
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second man convicted of attacking a
OL,7,Fgroup of teenagers and stealing a
OL,8,Fbicycle has been jailed.
OL,10,FDeclan Hyland, 29, Imran Ali, 41, and
OL,11,Fanother man, ambushed the three boys on
OL,12,Fa bridge between Ivatt Way and Bourges
OL,13,FBoulevard in Peterborough at about
OL,14,F17:00 BST on 18 April.
OL,16,FThey repeatedly punched them, using
OL,17,Fkeys held between their fingers as
OL,18,Fimprovised weapons, and Ali made off on
OL,19,Fone of their bikes, a Carrera worth
OL,20,F#600.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
